              2
            ]
          },
          "y_label": "Successful decoder returns"
        }
      ],
      "lead": "The original kernel reproduced the timing failure in a valid virtual machine. Its first observation contained two successful return records for the same process and no missed probe."
    },
    {
      "id": "next",
      "title": "Isolate the timing tool",
      "lead": "Keep the tool's non-target memory resident and prove that the target region is still eligible for swap. Use the same observer on both kernels before collecting any new comparison.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Independent XSwap still needs its guest driver and physical-route evidence. Pressure-driven migration depends on an independently verified XSwap frontend."
        }
      ]
    },
